# Copy this file to .env locally (or set as an environment variable on
# your host, e.g. PythonAnywhere's Web tab -> "Environment variables")
# Never commit the real .env file or a real key to git, and never paste
# a real key into a chat/document -- if a key is ever exposed, treat it
# as compromised and revoke/regenerate it immediately.
GROQ_API_KEY=your-key-here